            <a HREF="#LOCI">4. Loci with the Same Gene Name</a>
          </li>
          <li class="listmenu">
            <a HREF="#ALLELIC">5. Allelic Designations</a> &mdash; Sep 1996 update
          </li>
          <ul class="listmenu">
            <li class="listmenu">
              <a HREF="#INDEPENDENT">5.1. Alleles of Independent Mutational Origin</a>
            </li>
            <li class="listmenu">
              <a HREF="#NONMUTANT">5.2. Designation of Nonmutant Alleles</a>
            </li>
